invariant: INV-36
file: result.h
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: CH_MUST_USE expands to nothing under gcc and clang, so every mark
  stays in the headers and no compiler warns where a caller drops a result
  code. tools/must-use.py reads the headers after the preprocessor and
  requires warn_unused_result.

--- old
#define CH_MUST_USE __attribute__((warn_unused_result))
--- new
#define CH_MUST_USE
